    {"text": "The company plans the Bharuch plant (adding about 30% capacity) to begin commercial production in Q3 FY27; management expects data-centre cables to double from about 9% of domestic revenue within two years.", "citations": ["S3", "S2"], "evidence": [{"id": "S3:E10"}, {"id": "S2:E3"}]}
